## 3. Optimized Solution (Single Pass)

```python
from typing import List

class Solution:
    def longestMonotonicSubarray(self, nums: List[int]) -> int:
        n = len(nums)
        inc = 1
        dec = 1
        ans = 1

        for i in range(n - 1):
            if nums[i] < nums[i + 1]:
                inc += 1
                dec = 1

            elif nums[i] > nums[i + 1]:
                dec += 1
                inc = 1

            else:
                inc = 1
                dec = 1

            ans = max(ans, inc, dec)

        return ans
```

**Time Complexity:** O(n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

